{"id":"n1-237","title":"～んがために","romaji":"〜n ga tame ni","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Emphasizes the reason or purpose for an action; 'in order to', 'for the sake of'.","longExplanation":"The ～んがために form is a formal/literary expression meaning 'in order to' or 'for the purpose of.' It attaches to the negative stem (ない-form minus ない) of the verb: e.g., する -> せん, 行く -> いかん, 保つ -> たもたん, etc.","formation":"Verb-negative stem + んがために","examples":[{"jp":"健康を保たんがために、毎日運動をしています。","romaji":"Kenkou o tamotan ga tame ni, mainichi undou o shite imasu.","en":"I exercise daily in order to maintain my health.","words":[{"surface":"健康","vocabId":"1256170","reading":"けんこう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"保た","vocabId":"1513250","reading":"たもつ","baseForm":"保つ"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"運動","vocabId":"1172910","reading":"うんどう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6]},{"jp":"合格せんがために、一生懸命勉強します。","romaji":"Goukaku sen ga tame ni, isshoukenmei benkyou shimasu.","en":"I study hard in order to pass.","words":[{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"せ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一生懸命","vocabId":"1164010","reading":"いっしょうけんめい"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"明日の試験に備えんがため、今夜は早く寝るつもりです。","romaji":"Ashita no shiken ni sonaen ga tame, kon'ya wa hayaku neru tsumori desu.","en":"I plan to go to bed early so I can prepare for tomorrow’s exam.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"備えん","vocabId":"1244960","reading":"そなえん","baseForm":"備える"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ためる"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"今夜","vocabId":"1289520","reading":"こんや"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやく","baseForm":"早い"},{"surface":"寝る","vocabId":"1360010","reading":"ねる"},{"surface":"つもり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[]},{"jp":"彼女の笑顔を見んがために、毎日会いに行きます。","romaji":"Kanojo no egao o min ga tame ni, mainichi ai ni ikimasu.","en":"I go to see her every day in order to see her smile.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"笑顔","vocabId":"1351400","reading":"えがお"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"会い","vocabId":"1198180","reading":"あい","baseForm":"会う"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行きます","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いきます","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7,8]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Very formal, emphatic literary \"for the sake of/in order to\"; found in formal writing, rare in speech.","family":{"id":"purpose","name":"Purpose (In Order To / So That)","relatedPoints":["n4-010","n4-026","n4-059","